      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Top filly COMEANDSEE (1) added to the picket fence last start when she led from this barrier and took out the Breeders Challenge 2F Final at this circuit and distance. She has won six of her seven career runs and should dictate from the inside again so is hard to go past. YOUR SHUFFLE (7) closed well and was only 4.5 metres from COMEANDSEE in fourth in the Breeders Challenge Final last time after racing five-back on the fence for most of the trip. Look for her late again. PEACHESNCREAM (4) is first up for five months but has trialled and showed some promise with a win and a placing in two starts at her maiden campaign. FEROCIOUS LOVER (6) has ground to make up on COMEANDSEE through the last clash but was a Newcastle winner prior so may be worth including.",
